<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Jan-Apr trade gap narrows to $58.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Jan-Apr trade gap narrows to $58.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan posted a trade deficit of $58.3 million in the first four months of this year after a $134.0 million deficit in the same period of 1996, the National Statistics Committee said on Tuesday</p>
<p>KYRGYZ MERCHANDISE TRADE Jan-Apr 97  Jan-Mar 97  Jan-Apr 96</p>
<p>    exports			   113.3	  83.7	 117.0</p>
<p>    imports			   171.6	 136.4	 251.0</p>
<p>    trade balance		   -58.3	 -52.7	-134.0</p>
<p>Notes -- Figures in million dollars.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
